<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu Towa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu Towa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.60		vs	    9.21</p>
<p> Operating	  155    million    vs	   73    million</p>
<p> Current	     13    million    vs	   69    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 44    million    vs   loss 166    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.55 yen	  vs     loss 9.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujitsu Towa Electron Ltd is a maker of aluminim electrolytic capacitators and hybrid ICs.</p>
</text>
